		<Row Tag="LOC_VICTORY_MILITARY_LONGFORM">
			<Text>To win a Military Victory, you must have enough Dominion to dominate the other players. These points are earned by controlling Settlements, with extra points for those Settlements if they are Original Capitals, Conquered, or in Distant Lands.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_VICTORY_CULTURAL_LONGFORM">
			<Text>To win a Cultural Victory, you must have significantly more Tourism than all other players. Tourism is earned by constructing Wonders and Unique Buildings or Unique Improvements, having Natural Wonders within your borders, displaying Great Works, and having Celebrations.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_VICTORY_ECONOMIC_LONGFORM">
			<Text>To win an Economic Victory, you must have significantly more GDP than all other players. Several things contribute to your GDP each turn, including assigned Resources in Cities, active Gold buildings, Factories with assigned Factory Resources, and unloading Treasure Convoys.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_VICTORY_SCIENTIFIC_LONGFORM">
			<Text>To win a Scientific Victory, you must win the Space Race by being the first to earn 100 points and having an active Launch Pad in your empire. Earn points by completing special Scientific Projects each age, researching Tech Masteries, displaying Codices, and reaching Future Tech. The Launch Pad becomes available in the Modern Age and is unlocked by the Rocketry Tech.</Text>
